Requirements:

- ROOT remains available during all suite callbacks.
- Completing one suite must not release ROOT
  while another suite is still executing.
- All child contexts must be released before ROOT.
- No context with active bindings may be released.
- Separate executions must remain isolated.
- No orphan contexts or configuration layers
  should remain after execution cleanup.

